I'm nowhere near as powerful as Jean.","nextNodeIds":[200530105]},{"nodeId":200530105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":3001884929,"text":"I think it's better for me to focus on technique rather than power.","nextNodeIds":[200530106]},{"nodeId":200530106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":728315745,"text":"For example, I was thinking about how to break all these wooden dummies in one fell swoop.","nextNodeIds":[200530107]},{"nodeId":200530107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":1359830801,"text":"If you're at a loose end, fancy helping me think about how to tackle it?","nextNodeIds":[200530108,200530109]},{"nodeId":200530108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2985375025,"text":"I'll mull it over.","nextNodeIds":[200530110]},{"nodeId":200530110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":788375609,"text":"Sure, take your time. It's not like these dummies are going anywhere.","nextNodeIds":[200530111]},{"nodeId":200530111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":143152817,"text":"Nor is my life going anywhere while I'm stuck trying to sort this out, ugh...","nextNodeIds":[200530114]},{"nodeId":200530114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":3041651913,"text":"At this distance, maybe the best solution would be for me to deal with one side and drop a bomb to deal with the other side.","nextNodeIds":[200530115]},{"nodeId":200530115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":1812471369,"text":"Haha, just kidding. I have no idea where I would even get a bomb from anyway.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":200530109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1184792889,"text":"How about we give it a go together...","nextNodeIds":[200530112]},{"nodeId":200530112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":3231469577,"text":"You like team combat, then? Alright for some... always someone to help you out.","nextNodeIds":[200530113]},{"nodeId":200530113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":1813416713,"text":"For people like me, the best I can do is try and hold my own as a lone fighter.","nextNodeIds":[200530114]}]},{"talkId":2005302,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","beginCond":[{"param":["2005301","3",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["2005302","2",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":2005302,"initDialog":200530201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1605],"performCfg":"","priority":6,"questId":20053,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":200530201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":2693484633,"text":"How are you getting along? Had a eureka moment yet?","nextNodeIds":[200530202]},{"nodeId":200530202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1328759641,"text":"Stil